. * 6. TABULKA 2 — BINARNI LOGIT P(AI) ~ JOB FAMILY ^ SKILL CLUSTERY (AME, per zeme)
. * ==============================================================================
. * Dva komplementarni modely per zeme (celkem 6 sloupcu):
